  "ruleText": "Med 609.03 Change of Address. Licensees shall report any change in business or home address within 30 days of such change.\n\nSource. #6472, eff 3-25-97, EXPIRED: 3-25-05\n\nNew. #8678, eff 7-11-06, EXPIRED: 7-11-14\n\nNew. #10926, INTERIM, eff 9-4-15; ss by #11049, eff 3-2-16",
